│ Explanation:                                 │
│                                              │
│ The patch adds a check for UniqueConstraint  │
│ before calling in_bulk(). It iterates        │
│ through the model's constraints and, if a    │
│ constraint matches the field being updated,  │
│ it checks if the new value already exists in │
