│ in_bulk() is aborted, preventing the error.  │
│ This ensures that in_bulk() works correctly  │
│ even with UniqueConstraint fields.  The      │
│ check is performed before the                │
│ check_for_update method, ensuring that the   │
│ uniqueness check happens before any other    │
│ validation.                                  │
