│ is that Django’s in_bulk() method fails when │
│ a field has a UniqueConstraint instead of    │
│ unique=True. This is because in_bulk()       │
│ implicitly checks for uniqueness using       │
│ unique=True, and UniqueConstraint doesn’t    │
│ provide this behavior directly.              │
│                                              │
│ The fix involves modifying                   │
